# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE on what IS committed, deliberately:
#
#   data/      -- scenario CSVs, distance matrices, results. Small (~50 KB)
#                 and they are the evidence behind every number in the README.
#                 A reader should be able to check your arithmetic without
#                 re-running the whole pipeline or hitting the OSRM server.
#
#   outputs/   -- the Pareto plot and the interactive route maps. These are
#                 the artefacts the project exists to produce.
#
#   notebooks/ -- WITH their outputs. GitHub renders executed notebooks
#                 inline, so a visitor sees your results without running
#                 anything. That is most of the value of using notebooks.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
